ed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 43.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.23"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":42.9,"default_fair_val":42.9,"premium_pct":94,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":21.3,"pe_forward":18.7,"pb_trailing":4.8,"pb_forward":4.3,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":5.7,"fcf_to_ev":4.75,"fcf_to_mcap":4.36,"liab_to_assets":43,"cash_to_assets":22.2,"current_ratio":2.23,"roe":22.5,"roa":12.8,"moat":{"ticker":"NXT","period":"2027Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Nextpower 在太陽能產業中，透過其品牌 NextTracker 在追蹤系統領域建立了穩固的聲譽。雖然太陽能本身是商品化程度較高的產業，但 NextTracker 的技術創新和可靠性，使其在客戶心中建立了品牌價值，能夠在一定程度上支持其定價。相較於純粹的商品，其技術優勢和售後服務構成了品牌溢價的基礎。然而，產業內競爭激烈，其他廠商也在不斷追趕，因此定價權並非絕對，但其品牌已形成一道堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"Nextpower has established a solid reputation in the solar industry through its brand, NextTracker, in the field of tracking systems. Although solar energy itself is a highly commoditized industry, NextTracker's technological innovation and reliability have built brand value in the minds of its customers, allowing it to support its pricing to a certain extent. Compared to pure commodities, its technological advantages and after-sales service form the basis for brand premium. However, competition within the industry is fierce, and other manufacturers are constantly catching up, so pricing power is not absolute, but its brand has formed a solid moat."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Nextpower 在太陽能追蹤系統領域擁有一定的專利組合，這些專利涵蓋了其核心技術，為其產品提供了差異化優勢，並在一定程度上阻止了競爭對手的模仿。然而，太陽能產業的技術迭代速度快，專利保護的時效性相對有限。此外，雖然有監管政策支持再生能源發展，但這類支持通常是產業性的，而非針對特定公司的專利或特許權。因此，專利和監管環境提供了中等程度的保護。","comment_en":"Nextpower holds a certain patent portfolio in the solar tracker system field, which covers its core technologies and provides differentiated advantages for its products, to some extent preventing imitation by competitors. However, the pace of technological iteration in the solar industry is fast, and the timeliness of patent protection is relatively limited. Furthermore, although regulatory policies support the development of renewable energy, such support is generally industry-wide rather than specific patent or franchise rights for a particular company. Therefore, patents and the regulatory environment provide a moderate level of protection."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"太陽能電站的建設是一個複雜且資本密集的過程，一旦選定了追蹤系統供應商，更換的成本非常高昂。這不僅涉及設備本身的更換，還包括對安裝、調試、集成以及長期維護的影響。客戶需要重新培訓人員，調整操作流程，並可能面臨項目延遲和額外費用。這種高昂的轉換成本，使得客戶在選擇 Nextpower 的追蹤系統後，傾向於長期合作，為公司構建了較強的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"The construction of solar power plants is a complex and capital-intensive process. Once a tracking system supplier is selected, the cost of replacement is very high. This not only involves the replacement of the equipment itself but also affects installation, commissioning, integration, and long-term maintenance. Customers need to retrain personnel, adjust operational procedures, and may face project delays and additional costs. These high switching costs make customers tend to cooperate long-term after choosing Nextpower's tracking systems, building strong customer stickiness for the company."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"太陽能追蹤系統產業本身較少受到網絡效應的影響。網絡效應通常發生在平台型業務或社交互動頻繁的領域，例如社交媒體或電子市場。在太陽能領域，客戶購買決策主要基於技術性能、成本效益、可靠性和供應商的聲譽。雖然一個成功的項目可能帶來口碑效應，但這與嚴格意義上的網絡效應（即用戶越多，產品價值越高的情況）有所不同。因此，此維度得分較低。","comment_en":"The solar tracking system industry itself is less affected by network effects. Network effects typically occur in platform-based businesses or areas with frequent social interaction, such as social media or electronic marketplaces. In the solar sector, customer purchasing decisions are primarily based on technical performance, cost-effectiveness, reliability, and supplier reputation. While a successful project may generate word-of-mouth effects, this differs from network effects in the strict sense (i.e., the more users, the higher the value of the product). Therefore, the score for this dimension is low."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為太陽能追蹤系統領域的領導者之一，Nextpower 受益於其龐大的生產規模。規模經濟使其能夠降低單位生產成本，包括原材料採購、製造流程優化和供應鏈管理。這種成本優勢使其在價格競爭中更具彈性，並能為客戶提供更具吸引力的報價。同時，其穩定的現金流和強勁的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $550.7M）也支持其持續的規模擴張和技術投入，進一步鞏固了其成本領先地位。","comment_en":"As one of the leaders in the solar tracking system field, Nextpower benefits from its large production scale. Economies of scale allow it to reduce unit production costs, including raw material procurement, manufacturing process optimization, and supply chain management. This cost advantage makes it more flexible in price competition and enables it to offer more attractive quotes to customers. Meanwhile, its stable cash flow and strong free cash flow (FCF TTM: $550.7M) also support its continuous scale expansion and technological investment, further consolidating its cost leadership position."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"太陽能產業的地理因素主要體現在日照資源的差異上，而 Nextpower 作為設備供應商，其核心競爭力在於技術和製造，而非特定地理位置的資產。雖然其產品適用於全球各地，但並不存在類似礦產或特殊土地那樣的、由地理位置帶來的獨特且難以複製的資產壁壘。其業務的全球化佈局是戰略選擇，而非依賴於某個特定地點的稀缺性。因此，此維度的護城河相對較弱。","comment_en":"Geographical factors in the solar industry are mainly reflected in the differences in solar radiation resources. As an equipment supplier, Nextpower's core competitiveness lies in technology and manufacturing, rather than assets in specific geographical locations. Although its products are applicable worldwide, there are no unique and difficult-to-replicate asset barriers arising from geographical location, unlike those associated with minerals or special land. Its global business layout is a strategic choice, not dependent on the scarcity of a particular location. Therefore, the moat in this dimension is relatively weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Nextpower 在營運效率方面表現出色，這從其高 ROE (22.5%) 和 ROA (12.8%) 以及高 F-Score (8/9) 可以看出。這表明公司能夠有效地利用資產和股東權益來創造利潤。強勁的自由現金流 (FCF TTM: $550.7M) 進一步證明了其營運的健康和高效。這種卓越的營運能力不僅降低了成本，提高了盈利能力，也為公司提供了持續投資和創新的資金基礎，構成了重要的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Nextpower demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, as evidenced by its high ROE (22.5%) and ROA (12.8%), as well as a high F-Score (8/9). This indicates that the company can effectively utilize its assets and shareholder equity to generate profits. Strong free cash flow (FCF TTM: $550.7M) further confirms the health and efficiency of its operations. This superior operational capability not only reduces costs and improves profitability but also provides the company with a financial foundation for continuous investment and innovation, forming a significant competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Nextpower 在資本配置方面展現了卓越的管理能力。公司擁有健康的資產負債表（現金 $1,029.9M / 負債 $0.0M），並產生了強勁的自由現金流。這使得公司能夠靈活地進行再投資以擴大業務、進行研發以保持技術領先，並可能通過股票回購或股息向股東返還價值。其高 ROE 和 ROA 反映了資本配置的有效性。管理層能夠明智地運用資本，為股東創造長期價值，這是巴菲特高度重視的特質。","comment_en":"Nextpower demonstrates exceptional capital allocation management capabilities. The company boasts a healthy balance sheet (Cash $1,029.9M / Debt $0.0M) and generates strong free cash flow. This allows the company flexibility to reinvest in business expansion, conduct R&D to maintain technological leadership, and potentially return value to shareholders through share buybacks or dividends. Its high ROE and ROA reflect the effectiveness of its capital allocation. Management's ability to wisely deploy capital to create long-term shareholder value is a trait highly valued by Buffett."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，太陽能電站項目一旦採用 Nextpower 的追蹤系統，由於高昂的轉換成本和對系統穩定性的依賴，客戶通常會保持較長的合作關係。此外，公司透過提供優質的售後服務、技術支持和持續的產品升級，進一步加強了客戶忠誠度。這種基於信任和長期價值的客戶關係，構成了穩固的客戶留存壁壘，確保了公司收入的穩定性。","comment_en":"As mentioned in M3, once Nextpower's tracking systems are adopted for solar power plant projects, customers typically maintain long-term cooperative relationships due to the high switching costs and reliance on system stability. Furthermore, the company enhances customer loyalty by providing excellent after-sales service, technical support, and continuous product upgrades. This customer relationship, based on trust and long-term value, forms a solid barrier to customer retention, ensuring the stability of the company's revenue."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Nextpower 的護城河具有相當的持久性。其在太陽能追蹤系統領域的技術領先地位、規模經濟帶來的成本優勢、以及高轉換成本形成的客戶黏性，共同構成了穩固的競爭壁壘。再生能源產業的長期增長趨勢為公司提供了廣闊的發展空間。只要公司能持續創新並保持營運效率，其競爭優勢有望在未來很長一段時間內保持，使其成為一個具有持久價值的投資標的。","comment_en":"Nextpower's moat possesses considerable durability. Its technological leadership in the solar tracking system field, cost advantages derived from economies of scale, and customer stickiness formed by high switching costs collectively constitute a solid competitive barrier. The long-term growth trend of the renewable energy industry provides ample room for the company's development. As long as the company can continue to innovate and maintain operational efficiency, its competitive advantages are expected to persist for a considerable period, making it an investment target with enduring value."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Nextpower 憑藉其在太陽能追蹤系統領域的技術領導力、規模經濟帶來的成本優勢，以及高轉換成本形成的客戶黏性，構建了堅實的經濟護城河。其品牌價值和卓越的營運效率進一步鞏固了其市場地位。雖然網絡效應較弱，但其強勁的自由現金流和穩健的資產負債表，顯示出優秀的資本配置能力。整體而言，Nextpower 展現了類似於「收費橋」的特徵，即一旦客戶採用其系統，便難以更換，從而產生穩定的現金流和持久的競爭優勢。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Nextpower has built a solid economic moat through its technological leadership in the solar tracking system sector, cost advantages from economies of scale, and customer stickiness resulting from high switching costs. Its brand value and excellent operational efficiency further solidify its market position. Although network effects are weak, its strong free cash flow and sound balance sheet demonstrate excellent capital allocation capabilities. Overall, Nextpower exhibits characteristics similar to a 'toll bridge,' where once customers adopt its systems, replacement is difficult, leading to stable cash flows and a durable competitive advantage.","evidenceHash":"f6718a3a393b8b49f1786d396bd2bc26c49b68695dd765a01d95a4421843f040","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T14:27:37.060Z","evidenceHash":"49c21dabeea96a7afdbe4e825bb97585b3ca4e86a744bb339e658d73bd6887ed"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T14:27:37.060Z","evidenceHash":"49c21dabeea96a7afdbe4e825bb97585b3ca4e86a744bb339e658d73bd6887ed"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NXT.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NXT.png","website":"https://www.nextpower.com","ceo":"Daniel S. Shugar","full_time_employees":"1993","description":"Nextpower, Inc. engages in the provision of integrated solar tracker and software solutions used in utility-scale and ground-mounted distributed generation solar projects. Its products enable solar panels in utility-scale power plants to follow the sun's movement across the sky and optimize plant performance. The company was founded by Daniel S. Shugar, Alexander Au, Nicholas Miller, Michael Mehavich, Marco Garcia, and Tyroan Hardy in 2013 and is headquartered in Fremont, CA.","description_en":"Nextpower, Inc. engages in the provision of integrated solar tracker and software solutions used in utility-scale and ground-mounted distributed generation solar projects. Its products enable solar panels in utility-scale power plants to follow the sun's movement across the sky and optimize plant performance. The company was founded by Daniel S. Shugar, Alexander Au, Nicholas Miller, Michael Mehavich, Marco Garcia, and Tyroan Hardy in 2013 and is headquartered in Fremont, CA.","description_zh":"Nextpower Inc.（美股代碼：NXT）為 Energy 領域之重要企業，專注於 Solar 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"6200 Paseo Padre Parkway","city":"Fremont","state":"CA","zip":"94555","country":"US","phone":"510 270 2500","full_address":"6200 Paseo Padre Parkway, Fremont, CA 94555, US","range_52w":"75.405-163.13","year_high":163.13,"year_low":75.405,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":75.405,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-02","name":"BOYNTON CHARLES D","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":4500,"price":79.98,"total_val":0.36},{"date":"2026-08-24","name":"Blunden Julia","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":3723,"price":88.08,"total_val":0.33},{"date":"2026-08-24","name":"Blunden Julia","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":3692,"price":84.1,"total_val":0.31},{"date":"2026-08-20","name":"Thomas Brandi Elizabeth","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":7415,"price":91.25,"total_val":0.68},{"date":"2026-08-20","name":"Karuturi Monica","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2742,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"WATKINS WILLIAM D","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":3455,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"Thomas Brandi Elizabeth","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2742,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"SHIH WILLY C","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2742,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"Menezes Mark","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2742,